# Deny everything, then re-include only what the build actually needs. New files
# in the repo (tokens, logs, database dumps) then fail closed instead of getting
# baked into the published image, where every layer stays readable forever.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src
!sql
!config

# Secrets are passed in through the environment, never copied into the image.
**/*.env
